<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan grains/oilseeds tender results - March.</title>
<headline>Taiwan grains/oilseeds tender results - March.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan interests bought during March a total of 162,000 tonnes U.S. soybeans, 216,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 26,000 tonnes U.S. wheat at tenders.</p>
<p>Basic information of January soybean/corn tender results:</p>
<p>(Prices in US$ per tonne)</p>
<p> March Buyer    Tonne  Type Seller  Price   Delivery/Freight</p>
<p>  6    FGEP     54,000 corn Cargill $151.50 May 10-25/CNF</p>
<p>  7    BSPA-K   54,000 soy  Contine $.9903  April 6-20/CNF</p>
<p> 11    BSPA-C   54,000 soy  Contine $.9786  April 11-25 /CNF</p>
<p> 12    CK Group 51,000 corn Kanemat $139.85 May 26-June 23/CNF</p>
<p>	 CK Group  3,000 corn Kanemat $.5175  April 10-30/CNF</p>
<p>	 CK Group 43,000 corn Agrex   $153.73 April 10-30/CNF</p>
<p>	 CK Group 11,000 corn Agerx   $.8650  April 10-30/CNF</p>
<p> 13    MFIG     54,000 corn Angre   $144.25 May 16-30/CNF</p>
<p> 19    BSPA-K   54,000 soy  N/A     $.7325  April 21-May 20/CNF</p>
<p>Delivery periods for soybean and corn shipments are stated for the U.S. Gulf of Mexico. Shipments from the Pacific Northwest are 15 days after the Gulf.</p>
<p>Basic information of recent wheat tender results:</p>
<p>(Prices in US$ per tonne)</p>
<p>  March Buyer   Tonne  Type  Seller   Price   Delivery/Freight</p>
<p>  27    Flour					   May 5-25/$24.00</p>
<p>	  Mill    16,000 DNS   Mitsui   $198.20</p>
<p>	  Assoc    6,900 HRW   Continen $189.39</p>
<p>		     3,100 WW    Cargill  $168.13</p>
<p>March wheat tenders comprised Dark Northern Spring (DNS), Hard Red Winter (HRW), White Wheat (WW) and Soft Wheat (SW).</p>
<p>Wheat shipments all are slated for delivery from the Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
